# This directory IS the public repository — README, privacy policy, licence
# and the screenshots the README shows. Nothing else belongs here.
#
# Build output lives outside it, one level up, so a build can never queue
# something for the next push:
#
#   ../store/    store artwork and the plaintext privacy policy for AMO
#   ../site/     the matily.org/litrank/ landing page
#   ../promo/    the promo video
#
# If something unexpected shows up in `git status` here, the fix is to move it
# out rather than to add a line below.
